        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Daniel Boone\n- Places: Arcadia, Tennessee; Kentucky\n- Events: Green-Jones War\n- Projects: Daniel Boone's trail; National Road\n\nFacts:\n- In 1775, Daniel Boone's trail ran through Arcadia, Tennessee.\n- Daniel Boone's trail was an unofficial trail that led into Kentucky.\n- Daniel Boone's trail was near one of the locales of the Green-Jones War.\n- Daniel Boone's trail was turned down to become the National Road.",
